{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/15678-play-by-post-gaming","id":15678,"title":"Play-by-post gaming?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-21T15:35:19-08:00","id":15678,"title":"Play-by-post gaming?","content":"(I hope I'm not posting in a wrong forum - if so, I'm sorry)<br /> <br /> Would anyone here be interested in play-by-post / play-by-email gaming? I have quite a lot of WoD books and I'd like them to see some use.<br /> <br /> At this moment, I'd be especially interested in Vampire: the Requiem, Mummy: the Curse and Mage: the Awakening.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1245-varsovian","name":"Varsovian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-21T17:20:10-08:00","id":15720,"title":"","content":"Well, we are currently involved in a PBP Changeling Chronicle that is just starting, if that is something you want. You can find it here. <a href=\"http://z13.invisionfree.com/San_Diego_Lost/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">http://z13.invisionfree.com/San_Diego_Lost/index.php</a><br /> <br /> If that isn't your speed, take a look at Laceratus Praetorum in the Mage forum. I know the DM, and he will do a good job.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/863-doctor-lazarus","name":"Doctor Lazarus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-22T02:15:01-08:00","id":15993,"title":"","content":"Hi. I play at Edge of Darkness, we're a play by post site and have been around for six years. <a href=\"http://nwod.org/forum/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">http://nwod.org/forum/index.php</a> We've got mta, vtr, wtf and ctl.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1031-youvegotwildtalents","name":"youvegotwildtalents","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"80"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T00:10:44-07:00","id":197630,"title":"","content":"Going to go ahead and necro this post because I'm interested in PbP WoD games. Please post more links, guys! Or start a new one!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2165-macai","name":"Macai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2165_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T17:12:47-07:00","id":201589,"title":"","content":"I was actually on nwod.org for almost a year, but I got sick of being forced to agree with everything the (not)admin West said or being faced with a ban. Not only he had this really broken idea of how VtR worked that basically boiled down to 'Vampires are evil because I say so' with no respect for the idea that the point of Storytelling systems are to provide an experience that can be whatever the players and STs want it to be.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I was wondering if anyone knew of a PbP site I could join?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3513-moonfang","name":"Moonfang","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-19T08:22:54-07:00","id":202148,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Moonfang</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/15678-play-by-post-gaming?p=201589#post201589\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was actually on nwod.org for almost a year, but I got sick of being forced to agree with everything the (not)admin West said or being faced with a ban. Not only he had this really broken idea of how VtR worked that basically boiled down to 'Vampires are evil because I say so' with no respect for the idea that the point of Storytelling systems are to provide an experience that can be whatever the players and STs want it to be.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I was wondering if anyone knew of a PbP site I could join?</div> </div> </div> </div>Check your PMs or email me at <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#116679786574667e7d773f61627464757e7f687c51767c70787d3f727e7c\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"3a4d52534e5f4d55565c144a495f4f5e555443577a5d575b535614595557\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/190-audrey-st-john","name":"Audrey St. John","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar190_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"346"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T13:38:40-07:00","id":207480,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:red\">If you're engaged in a dispute involving another web site, please don't discuss it here. We want to avoid cross-site drama, hence <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\">Rule 9</a>.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-21T08:34:28-07:00","id":262191,"title":"","content":"A little bit of necro here, sorry about that. I was just checking out some play by post sites and I checked out Edge of Darkness. And it were all meetings. I don't want cross-site drama as well, but is that normal for the WoD play by post? You have a meeting (court, covenant, clan) and everyone comes in and tells what's he or she is wearing and what he or she thinks and that's it. It seems a bit aimless. Not looking for a dungeon crawl either, but in my games all social interaction has a point. It is usually about getting something done via manipulation, intimidation or bluff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1873-jan-paparazzi","name":"Jan Paparazzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1873_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"257"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-21T22:44:53-07:00","id":262674,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jan Paparazzi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/15678-play-by-post-gaming?p=262191#post262191\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A little bit of necro here, sorry about that. I was just checking out some play by post sites and I checked out Edge of Darkness. And it were all meetings. I don't want cross-site drama as well, but is that normal for the WoD play by post? You have a meeting (court, covenant, clan) and everyone comes in and tells what's he or she is wearing and what he or she thinks and that's it. It seems a bit aimless. Not looking for a dungeon crawl either, but in my games all social interaction has a point. It is usually about getting something done via manipulation, intimidation or bluff.</div> </div> </div> </div>Courts are the regular 'monthly' thing that happens in the game. Sometimes Coven and Clans do similar meetings either before or after. Aside from that there are Glimpses which are single post short stories used to advance the character or fulfill the requirement to lift a penalty from your character's vitae count. <br /> <br /> They sometimes attempt to run structured story plots, but I've never seen one reach conclusion. In fact, I was in one that had people dropping out of it freqently and I was the last one in it. As I had left, that left no one to my knowledge currently playing it.<br /> <br /> Aside from that, shards maybe started. These are open scenes in which anyone may join, sometimes even cross venue. But those are rare. <br /> <br /> In all honestly, there isn't really much to post about outside of those. I tried once to get a Patrol thread going and no one showed up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3513-moonfang","name":"Moonfang","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-23T14:17:10-07:00","id":264112,"title":"","content":"OK, I see. Thanks. I found it so odd. Nothing against meetings or gatherings, but when they are 80% or more of what people do ... well it didn't seem to go anywhere. Just people entering a bar and telling what they wear today and what they think. But now I know why that is. Most people play in chatrooms, I guess.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1873-jan-paparazzi","name":"Jan Paparazzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1873_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"257"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-23T20:00:33-07:00","id":264355,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jan Paparazzi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/15678-play-by-post-gaming?p=264112#post264112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">OK, I see. Thanks. I found it so odd. Nothing against meetings or gatherings, but when they are 80% or more of what people do ... well it didn't seem to go anywhere. Just people entering a bar and telling what they wear today and what they think. But now I know why that is. Most people play in chatrooms, I guess.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, chatroom RP is rare in Edge of Darkness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3513-moonfang","name":"Moonfang","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-24T14:21:32-07:00","id":264870,"title":"","content":"No I mean in general. I don't see a lot of play by post. That Vancouver site is gone. Pulled the plug. And this nwod is not my thing if it's mostly gatherings and not much else. I am looking for some more play by post sites. I want to try it and get some more experience. Roleplaying in real life is a but on and off. Nothing regular. So I figured this might be a good idea to see some more gameplay.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1873-jan-paparazzi","name":"Jan Paparazzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1873_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"257"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-24T20:33:11-07:00","id":265139,"title":"","content":"Nothing keeping you from joining and making scenes for your own enjoyment, have people come in and out as they please. Hell, you might be what lifts up the joint.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3513-moonfang","name":"Moonfang","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-25T17:35:16-07:00","id":265829,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">I know what you mean, Jan Paparazzi. Most of the World of Darkness pbp games I've been on lately have either died or are just about to. I'm looking for another one to play as I type this. Please let me know if you find anything. And before you ask, yes, I have thought about setting up an Edge of Darkness account, but none of the people in that forum appear to have any interest in playing the Second Edition of the World of Darkness (aka the chronicles books) at the moment. That said, it has been awhile since I've been to their forums, perhaps they're hosting those games now? Lemme check... Anyway, if you're looking to play some First Edition New World of Darkness, that might be the place for you.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","user":"ocel","date":". 09-25-2014, 08:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-26T11:03:11-07:00","id":266308,"title":"","content":"I'd be interested in playing something on a 1 on 1 level. I run a few games like that, slice of life sort of thing and a couple larger groups ( one in person, one online )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-26T16:38:29-07:00","id":266504,"title":"","content":"I found some general play by post sites. They have nwod games, but also D&amp;D and Cthulhu etc. <br /> <br /> This one quite allright and the forum is nicely split up in different categories. <a href=\"https://www.rpgcrossing.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rpgcrossing.com/</a><br /> This is one is smply huge. There is a search function to find the game you are looking for. <a href=\"http://rpol.net/\" target=\"_blank\">http://rpol.net/</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1873-jan-paparazzi","name":"Jan Paparazzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1873_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"257"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-28T19:51:00-07:00","id":267883,"title":"","content":"I'd be interested in doing a small, perhaps even solo nWoD pbp here with someone... My preferred splats atm are Demon, Geist and Changeling.<br /> <br /> By that I mean playing though, not running... I'm far more comfortable playing than being an ST!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-31T20:54:52-07:00","id":904692,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vitalis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/15678-play-by-post-gaming?p=266308#post266308\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd be interested in playing something on a 1 on 1 level. I run a few games like that, slice of life sort of thing and a couple larger groups ( one in person, one online )</div> </div> </div> </div>You might be interested in this, then: <a href=\"http://thefinalcrossroads.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://thefinalcrossroads.com/</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10158-thestranjer","name":"TheStranjer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10158_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T23:44:02-07:00","id":905434,"title":"","content":"If anyone is still looking and interested in V:tM, take a look to this: <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://s15.zetaboards.com/Silence_and_Whispers/index/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://s15.zetaboards.com/Silence_and_Whispers/index/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div>